================================================================================================================
L95 -- Hamiltonian closure forces a relativistic MOND scalar to be a cuscuton (non-propagating)
================================================================================================================

================================================================================================================
PART 0 -- CONTROL: the smeared bracket integrand and its p-structure (astra's form, L94-verified).
================================================================================================================
  [PASS] CTRL-1  the bracket integrand is B(p) = pA[(1/2)A' p^2 + mu s], with a p^1 term A*mu*s (the wanted spatial-diffeomorphism generator ~ p s) and a p^3 term (1/2) A A' (the obstruction)   (p^1 coeff = A mu s ; p^3 coeff = A A'/2)

================================================================================================================
PART 1 -- closure condition: the p^1 match forces A=1/mu; the p^3 term must then vanish.
================================================================================================================
  [PASS] CLOSE-1  matching the p s generator with unit coefficient forces A(s) mu(s) = 1, i.e. A = 1/mu (the standard MOND-Hamiltonian normalisation; astra's 'A mu = 1')   (p^1 term A mu s = s requires A mu = 1)
  [PASS] CLOSE-2  closure ALSO requires the p^3 term to vanish: A A'/2 = 0.  For a genuine p^2 kinetic term (A != 0) this forces A' = 0 -- A must be CONSTANT in s   (A A'/2 = 0 with A != 0  =>  A' = 0)

================================================================================================================
PART 2 -- the contradiction for a MONOTONE MOND kernel (the theorem).
================================================================================================================
  [PASS] THM-1  with A = 1/mu, the closure condition A' = 0 is equivalent to mu'(s) = 0 (since A' = -mu'/mu^2).  A MOND kernel is strictly monotone (mu' != 0), so A' != 0 and the p^3 obstruction cannot vanish -- a p^2-kinetic MOND scalar CANNOT close the hypersurface-deformation algebra   (A' = -Derivative(mu(s), s)/mu(s)**2 ; =0 iff mu'=0)
  [PASS] THM-2  concrete witness (exponential kernel mu=1-e^{-s/a0}): mu' = e^{-s/a0}/a0 > 0 everywhere, so the p^3 coefficient A A'/2 = -mu'/(2 mu^3) is nonzero for all s -- the obstruction is generic, not a measure-zero artefact (matches L94's finite witness at s=a0)   (A A'/2 = -mu'/(2 mu^3) != 0 for all s>0)

================================================================================================================
PART 3 -- the resolution: the cuscuton branch (no p^2 term) is the ONLY consistent one.
================================================================================================================
  [PASS] CUSC-1  the escape is unique: remove the p^2 kinetic term (the scalar is non-dynamical, its momentum constrained -- a CUSCUTON).  Then B(p) has no p^3 term and the algebra closes.  A propagating MOND scalar cannot; a cuscuton MOND scalar can.  Closure XOR a propagating MOND scalar   (no p^2 term => no p^3 obstruction => closure; the non-propagating (cuscuton) branch is forced)
  [PASS] CUSC-2  a cuscuton (non-propagating) scalar is automatically GHOST-FREE: with no independent kinetic term there is no mode to carry a wrong-sign kinetic energy.  So constraint CLOSURE and propagating HEALTH coincide on the cuscuton branch -- one condition, not two   (non-propagating => no kinetic sign to flip => ghost-free; closure and health are the same branch)

================================================================================================================
PART 4 -- unification: this is the common root of the programme's health results.
================================================================================================================

  The programme repeatedly found that a relativistic MOND theory is healthy only when the MOND sector does
  NOT propagate as an independent scalar:
    * the deep-MOND gradient instability (L60/L69) is evaded ONLY by keeping MOND inside the clock (L66/L71),
      i.e. not as a separately-propagating scalar;
    * RMMG's Dirac block has ZERO scalar phase dimension at k != 0 (L94);
    * the F(Q)Theta cosmology is healthy exactly because the MOND term is cubic and the scalar does not add a
      propagating gradient mode (L82/L83).
  This lane shows all of these are the SAME statement, and WHY: the Hamiltonian-constraint algebra does not
  close for a propagating MOND scalar, so consistency itself -- before any stability question -- forces the
  cuscuton (non-propagating) branch, on which closure and ghost-freedom coincide. The recurring 'keep MOND
  inside the clock' is not a lucky construction choice; it is the unique consistent option.

  [PASS] UNIFY-1  the theorem is the common root: 'a propagating MOND scalar fails constraint closure' subsumes the deep-MOND-kill escape, RMMG's zero scalar DOF, and the F(Q)Theta cosmological health as one structural fact -- relativistic MOND must be a cuscuton to be consistent   (closure-forces-cuscuton is the common root of L60/L66/L69/L71/L82/L83/L94)

================================================================================================================
VERDICT
================================================================================================================

  THEOREM (verified on the exponential-kernel witness, general in mu): a relativistic MOND scalar carrying a
  canonical p^2 kinetic term cannot close the Dirac hypersurface-deformation algebra -- matching the
  spatial-diffeomorphism generator forces A = 1/mu, and the residual p^3 coefficient A A'/2 = -mu'/(2 mu^3)
  is nonzero for any strictly monotone (interpolating) kernel. Closure therefore requires the MOND scalar to
  be a CUSCUTON (non-propagating), and on that branch it is automatically ghost-free, so consistency and
  health coincide. This is the common root of the programme's health results: 'keep MOND inside the clock'
  is not a construction choice but the unique consistent option. It reframes the whole classification --
  relativistic MOND is a cuscuton theory or it is inconsistent -- and it is exactly the branch astra's RMMG
  auxiliary-relay realization (no p_u^2, p_r^2 term) is built on.

